# Local benchmark CLI JSON reports (--json <name>.json) -- never meant to
# be committed, just scratch output from local/CLI verification runs.
# Covers this project's actual naming so far (backlog-fix-test.json,
# backlog128-monitored.json, benchmark-report.json, chunk250-test.json,
# event-loop-fix-test.json) plus the same convention going forward.
# None of these suffixes collide with a tracked file (package.json,
# package-lock.json, tsconfig.json, src/db/migrations/meta/*.json).
*-test.json
*-monitored.json
*-report.json
benchmark.json